  "description": "In this incredibly easy no-cook recipe, macerated fresh cherries are treated with a sweet-sour mixture of honey and red wine vinegar, then topped with black pepper and served with good ricotta cheese, crushed marcona almonds, and mint.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: Toasted crusty bread, for serving (optional); Fresh mint leaves, for garnish; Flaky salt, such as Maldon (optional)\n\nNotes: It's important to seek out high-quality fresh ricotta cheese, since the mass-market brands usually found at supermarkets won't perform well in this simple recipe.\nIf you don't have Marcona almonds, substitute an equal quantity of macadamia nuts.",
